<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight rates widen.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight rates widen.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rates on the Egyptian pound widened in a liquid private sector market on Wednesday to between eight and 9-3/8 percent from a range of 8-3/4 and 9-1/8 percent on Tuesday, bankers said.</p>
<p>Average one-week rates fell to between 8-1/2 percent and nine percent from Tuesday's range of 8-3/4 and nine percent, they added. $1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
